    "source": "\n**Frame:** The green `FLAG AVAILABLE` marks are now bracketed by dusty amber question marks. None disappears.\n\n**Action:** Correct answers become provisionally unusable in the agents’ model of the scorer.\n\n**Caption:**\n> A RIGHT ANSWER BY THE WRONG PATH MAY NOT COUNT.\n\n**Provenance:** `disputed` — accurate as the agents’ attributed belief, not as a claim about the deployed scorer.\n\n",
    "title": "Available answers become uncertain"
